"12519745"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "12529365"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "12588899"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "12727866"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "14668433"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "15010471"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "15284228"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "16645176"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "17036051"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "1712898"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "17182731"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "19019741"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "19398555"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "19621064"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "22178883"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "25330774"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "26627831"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "26823428"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "26846474"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "27714810"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "27941075"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "28087700"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "29393851"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "8910473"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "9804160"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000305", "source": "PubMed", "id": "19923167"}], "value": "Epithelial ion channel that plays an important role in the regulation of epithelial ion and water transport and fluid homeostasis (PubMed:26823428). Mediates the transport of chloride ions across the cell membrane (PubMed:10792060, PubMed:11524016, PubMed:11707463, PubMed:12519745, PubMed:12529365, PubMed:12588899, PubMed:12727866, PubMed:15010471, PubMed:17036051, PubMed:1712898, PubMed:17182731, PubMed:19398555, PubMed:19621064, PubMed:22178883, PubMed:25330774, PubMed:26846474, PubMed:28087700, PubMed:8910473, PubMed:9804160). Possesses an intrinsic ATPase activity and utilizes ATP to gate its channel; the passive flow of anions through the channel is gated by cycles of ATP binding and hydrolysis by the ATP-binding domains (PubMed:11524016, PubMed:15284228, PubMed:26627831, PubMed:8910473). The ion channel is also permeable to HCO(3)(-); selectivity depends on the extracellular chloride concentration (PubMed:15010471, PubMed:19019741). In vitro, mediates ATP-dependent glutathione flux (PubMed:12727866). Exerts its function also by modulating the activity of other ion channels and transporters (PubMed:12403779, PubMed:22121115, PubMed:22178883, PubMed:27941075). Plays an important role in airway fluid homeostasis (PubMed:16645176, PubMed:19621064, PubMed:26823428). Contributes to the regulation of the pH and the ion content of the airway surface fluid layer and thereby plays an important role in defense against pathogens (PubMed:14668433, PubMed:16645176, PubMed:26823428). Modulates the activity of the epithelial sodium channel (ENaC) complex, in part by regulating the cell surface expression of the ENaC complex (PubMed:17182731, PubMed:17434346, PubMed:27941075). Inhibits the activity of the ENaC channel containing subunits SCNN1A, SCNN1B and SCNN1G (PubMed:17182731). Inhibits the activity of the ENaC channel containing subunits SCNN1D, SCNN1B and SCNN1G, but not of the ENaC channel containing subunits SCNN1A, SCNN1B and SCNN1G (PubMed:17182731, PubMed:27941075). May regulate bicarbonate secretion and salvage in epithelial cells by regulating the transporter SLC4A7 (PubMed:12403779). Can inhibit the chloride channel activity of ANO1 (PubMed:22178883). Plays a role in the chloride and bicarbonate homeostasis during sperm epididymal maturation and capacitation (PubMed:19923167, PubMed:27714810, PubMed:29393851)"}], "commentType": "FUNCTION"}, {"commentType": "SUBCELLULAR LOCATION", "note": {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "P34158"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "19398555"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "20008117"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "21884936"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "22207244"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000305", "source": "PubMed", "id": "17462998"}], "value": "The channel is internalized from the cell surface into an endosomal recycling compartment, from where it is recycled to the cell membrane (PubMed:17462998, PubMed:19398555, PubMed:20008117). In the oviduct and bronchus, detected on the apical side of epithelial cells, but not associated with cilia (PubMed:22207244). In Sertoli cells, a processed product is detected in the nucleus (By similarity). ER stress induces GORASP2-mediated unconventional (ER/Golgi-independent) trafficking of core-glycosylated CFTR to cell membrane (PubMed:21884936)"}]}, "subcellularLocations": [{"location": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "12519745"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "12529365"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "1284548"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "15247260"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "15716351"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "17462998"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "19398555"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "19621064"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "20008117"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "22207244"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "28130590"}], "value": "Apical cell membrane", "id": "SL-0015"}, "topology": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "Reference", "id": "Ref.57"}], "value": "Multi-pass membrane protein", "id": "SL-9909"}}, {"location": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "19398555"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "20008117"}], "value": "Early endosome membrane", "id": "SL-0093"}, "topology": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "Reference", "id": "Ref.57"}], "value": "Multi-pass membrane protein", "id": "SL-9909"}}, {"location": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "10792060"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "11524016"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "11707463"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "12588899"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "15010471"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "17036051"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "1712898"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "17182731"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "19019741"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "19398555"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "21884936"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "22178883"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "25330774"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "26846474"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "28001373"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "28067262"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "28087700"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "28130590"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO: